# Files that must never be uploaded as public assets.
# The public surface is the released static site only: index.html,
# favicon.ico, styles/, scripts/. The DigitalOcean origin serves the same
# set from /opt/public-apps/trump-goggles/current. src/ holds the Worker
# entry; it must never be reachable as an asset. Local secret files
# (.dev.vars*, .env*) must never deploy either.
